532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E (The core tension is this: a robot operating on an assembly line, in a surgical suite, or inside a warehouse does not have the luxury of finishing one task before reacting to another. If a sensor detects an obstruction while the arm is mid-swing, the response cannot wait for the current motion to complete. The consequences of that delay can range from a broken part to a serious safety incident.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
