/P 1495 0 R
/T (Develop a professional web dashboard using Three.js that loads real .OBJ model files uploaded by the user, assembles them into a correctly hierarchical 5-DOF robotic arm with a mechanically accurate gripper, and animates joint rotations in real time as angle data arrives from QNX.)
/E (Develop a professional web dashboard using Three.js that loads real .OBJ model files uploaded by the user, assembles them into a correctly hierarchical 5-DOF robotic arm with a mechanically accurate gripper, and animates joint rotations in real time as angle data arrives from QNX.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
548 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 1496 0 R
/T (Implement and visually demonstrate the behavioural difference between RTOS mode \(simultaneous joint movement, immediate emergency preemption, no jitter under load\) and NON-RTOS mode \(sequential joint movement, delayed emergency response, visible jitter under simulated CPU load\) within the same dashboard.)
/E (Implement and visually demonstrate the behavioural difference between RTOS mode \(simultaneous joint movement, immediate emergency preemption, no jitter under load\) and NON-RTOS mode \(sequential joint movement, delayed emergency response, visible jitter under simulated CPU load\) within the same dashboard.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
