/P 169 0 R
/E (The ten papers reviewed below collectively map the landscape of real-time robotic control, from low-level OS scheduling to application-level kinematic simulation and rehabilitation robotics. Each study contributes a piece of the picture that M.A.T.R.I.X. brings together.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
