581 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 169 0 R
/E (Working within the QNX environment, Xu alongside colleagues tackled Modbus protocols through a serial interface. Communication linking industrial devices to control units formed the core of their focus. Without lag, information must move in automated setups. Since timing precision matters, QNX supports consistent message delivery. Continuous data flow between machinery demands responsiveness, as highlighted in their study. Real-time performance proves essential where operations never pause. This early study establishes QNX as a viable OS for industrial communication and is directly relevant to the network architecture chosen for this project.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
