598 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 171 0 R
/E (Simulation played a key part in shaping how robotic systems are built, according to the researchers. Through MATLAB, movements of the robotic arm came under close examination. Instead of physical trials, various trajectories got evaluated within virtual environments. By spotting flaws early, adjustments happened long before hardware assembly began. Financial demands during creation dropped when digital models replaced some real-world testing. This second entry from Narayana et al. reinforces the academic validity of the digital-twin approach, where the Three.js dashboard acts as the simulation environment for the QNX controller.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
