/T (The following results were obtained from the completed M.A.T.R.I.X. system during live demonstration runs. Each figure shows a specific part of the system working as designed, from the initial project setup interface all the way through to the QNX RTOS controller executing recorded pose sequences in real time. Taken together, these results confirm that all five original project objectives were met and that the system operates correctly end-to-end under both normal and stress conditions.)
/E (The following results were obtained from the completed M.A.T.R.I.X. system during live demonstration runs. Each figure shows a specific part of the system working as designed, from the initial project setup interface all the way through to the QNX RTOS controller executing recorded pose sequences in real time. Taken together, these results confirm that all five original project objectives were met and that the system operates correctly end-to-end under both normal and stress conditions.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
