/E (The Motion Task held its 100 ms period consistently in every normal-operation run. The Watchdog did not fire once during those sessions. When we deliberately starved the QNX VM of CPU time, the Watchdog caught every violation and logged it correctly. The deadline monitoring mechanism worked exactly as designed.)
/Pg 35 0 R
