/E (We tested emergency stop 15 times in each mode. In RTOS mode, pressing Enter on the QNX terminal to the arm going red on the dashboard took an average of about 28 milliseconds, always under 50 ms. In NON-RTOS mode the same action took between 220 and 380 milliseconds, with the arm visibly continuing to move after the trigger in every trial)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [9]
>>
