/Title (In NON-RTOS mode, that guarantee was gone. The stop command had to queue behind whatever was already running. On a lightly loaded machine the wait was short. Under heavy load it stretched to hundreds of milliseconds. In a real arm with real hardware, that gap is long enough for a dangerous motion to complete. This project made that distinction something you could see on screen, not just accept from a textbook.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
