/Title (The biggest takeaway here is not that RTOS is faster on average. It is that RTOS is consistent. In RTOS mode the system behaved the same way every single time, no matter what else was running. The Safety Task always preempted the Motion Task the moment it was triggered because SCHED_FIFO does not let a higher-priority thread wait.)
/Dest [37 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2166 0 R
/Prev 2203 0 R
/Next 2186 0 R
>>
endobj
